---@field dryRun? string When present, indicates that modifications should not be persisted. An invalid or unrecognized dryRun directive will result in an error response and no further processing of the request. Valid values are: - All: all dry run stages will be processed
---@field fieldSelector? string A selector to restrict the list of returned objects by their fields. Defaults to everything.
