---@field device? string device represents the name of the device. If device is set, only devices with that name are selected. This field corresponds to slice.spec.devices[].name. Setting also driver and pool may be required to avoid ambiguity, but is not required.
---@field driver? string driver is the driver name. If driver is set, only devices from that driver are selected. This fields corresponds to slice.spec.driver.
